        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.mp4?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dingir OS – the finest and only operating system that includes everything you need to explore the Deep Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a closed system created by the netstalker group NOOSPHERE, it is now available to you! Inside, you'll find not only engaging programs for surfing the darkest corners of the network but also diaries of group members, voice recordings, and even digital artifacts collected by netstalkers over many years years years years of research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please treat the contents of this OS with the utmost seriousness. We cannot guarantee your safety. Everything inside is to be explored at your own peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=798 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.mp4?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A short interactive horror story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Point-and-click interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep lore of netstalker culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A multimedia library of terrifying files</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.mp4?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dingir OS – the finest and only operating system that includes everything you need to explore the Deep Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a closed system created by the netstalker group NOOSPHERE, it is now available to you! Inside, you'll find not only engaging programs for surfing the darkest corners of the network but also diaries of group members, voice recordings, and even digital artifacts collected by netstalkers over many years years years years of research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please treat the contents of this OS with the utmost seriousness. We cannot guarantee your safety. Everything inside is to be explored at your own peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.poster.avif?t=1772724253\" width=798 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.webm?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.mp4?t=1772724253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A short interactive horror story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Point-and-click interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deep lore of netstalker culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A multimedia library of terrifying files</p>",
        "short_description": "Congratulations, you've found Dingir OS — an operating system that lets you glimpse into the darkest corners of the internet. Browse forbidden websites, investigate lethal files, and immerse yourself in the world of digital legends. (We are not responsible for anything that may happen to you.)",
